    "Standard (16 to 24 GB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard (16 à 24 Go)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Démarrage…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêtée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take over here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reprendre ici"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk from another app": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parler depuis une autre app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to Maé from your iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parle à Maé depuis ton iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to the assistant to see measurements.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parle à l’assistant pour voir les mesures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tâches"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test en cours…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant runs entirely on this Mac, without the Internet. It first needs its models: one download, and the connection is not used any more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant fonctionne entièrement sur ce Mac, sans Internet. Il lui faut d’abord ses modèles : un seul téléchargement, et la connexion ne sert plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant stops and its models are erased from this Mac. To use it again, they will have to be downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant s’arrête et ses modèles sont effacés de ce Mac. Pour s’en servir à nouveau, il faudra les télécharger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant will restart with %@. If it is not on this Mac yet, it will have to be downloaded (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant va redémarrer avec %@. S’il n’est pas encore sur ce Mac, il faudra le télécharger (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code stays between this Mac and your iPhone: the relay cannot read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le code reste entre ce Mac et ton iPhone : le relais ne peut pas le lire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation goes on on your iPhone until you take over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation continue sur ton iPhone tant que tu ne reprends pas la main."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation will appear here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation s’affichera ici"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine did not start": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur n’a pas démarré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first launch can take a minute or two.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le premier lancement peut prendre une à deux minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is blocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro est bloqué"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone or the speakers could not be opened. Check that they are connected, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro ou les haut-parleurs n’ont pas pu être ouverts. Vérifie qu’ils sont branchés, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model server (Hugging Face) refuses a file (error %@). The app probably needs an update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur des modèles (Hugging Face) refuse un fichier (erreur %@). Il faudra probablement une mise à jour de l’app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model “%@”, which ships with the app, cannot be found: the app is probably damaged. Reinstall it from its disk image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle « %@ », livré avec l’app, est introuvable : l’app est sans doute abîmée. Réinstalle-la depuis son image disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models are saved in %@. You can quit the app during the download: it will resume where it stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles sont enregistrés dans %@. Tu peux quitter l’app pendant le téléchargement : il reprendra là où il s’est arrêté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models could not be saved on the disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible d’enregistrer les modèles sur le disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The relay does not answer. Your iPhone can reach you at home only. I keep trying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais ne répond pas. Ton iPhone ne peut te joindre qu’à la maison. Je réessaie toute seule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tier decides the language model. “Automatic” picks the one that suits this Mac's memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le palier décide du modèle de langage. « Automatique » choisit celui qui convient à la mémoire de ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réflexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is not supported": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac n’est pas compatible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address doesn’t answer like a SearXNG (code %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse ne répond pas comme un SearXNG (code %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address doesn’t answer like a SearXNG.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse ne répond pas comme un SearXNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code a expiré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This conversation": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tier could not be tested: performance is estimated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce palier n’a pas pu être testé : les performances sont estimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tier needs more memory than this Mac has: the assistant may be very slow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce palier demande plus de mémoire que ce Mac n’en a : l’assistant risque d’être très lent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tier": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À télécharger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To hear you, the assistant needs the microphone. Allow it in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Microphone, then come back here. Sound never leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour t’entendre, l’assistant a besoin du micro. Autorise-le dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité › Micro, puis reviens ici. Le son ne quitte jamais ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens already in memory": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots déjà en mémoire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens computed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots calculés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcription": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the address of your SearXNG first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tape d’abord l’adresse de ton SearXNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untested tier: performance is estimated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palier non testé : performances estimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identifiant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name, if it asks for one": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identifiant, s’il en demande un"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid for another": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valable encore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice cut after (median)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voix coupée en (médiane)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice dropouts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coupures de la voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your iPhone…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de ton iPhone…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attend ton oui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it may do": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu’il peut faire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What went wrong": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui n’a pas marché"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you search for goes out on the internet: to your SearXNG, then to the search engines. The rest of the conversation stays on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tu cherches part sur internet : vers ton SearXNG, puis vers les moteurs de recherche. Le reste de la conversation reste sur ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you search for goes to Brave Search. The rest of the conversation stays on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tu cherches part chez Brave Search. Le reste de la conversation reste sur ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With headphones there is no echo, so the microphone is used as is. Avoid this mode with speakers: the assistant would interrupt itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec un casque, il n’y a pas d’écho : le micro est utilisé tel quel. Évite ce mode sur les haut-parleurs, l’assistant se couperait la parole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a relay, your iPhone reaches you at home only, on the same Wi-Fi as this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans relais, ton iPhone ne te joint qu’à la maison, sur le même Wi-Fi que ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can now talk to Maé from your iPhone, at home and away. Keep this Mac on and plugged in so that it stays reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux maintenant parler à Maé depuis ton iPhone, à la maison comme ailleurs. Garde ce Mac allumé et branché pour qu’il reste joignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can now talk to Maé from your iPhone, at home. Keep this Mac on and plugged in so that it stays reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux maintenant parler à Maé depuis ton iPhone, à la maison. Garde ce Mac allumé et branché pour qu’il reste joignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a Mac with Apple silicon (M1 or later) and at least 8 GB of memory. This Mac: %@, %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il faut un Mac avec une puce Apple (M1 ou plus récente) et au moins 8 Go de mémoire. Ce Mac : %@, %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Brave key has reached its limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta clé Brave a atteint sa limite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac has turned off its microphone and speakers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton Mac a coupé son micro et ses haut-parleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG asks for a user name and a password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG demande un identifiant et un mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG doesn’t accept programs: turn on its JSON format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG n’accepte pas les programmes : active son format JSON."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG refuses the password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG refuse le mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG takes OpenMaé for a robot: protect it with a password and turn off its bot protection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG prend OpenMaé pour un robot : protège-le par un mot de passe et coupe sa protection anti-robots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone cannot wake a sleeping Mac. With the lid closed and no external display, the Mac sleeps anyway.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton iPhone ne peut pas réveiller un Mac en veille. Capot fermé et sans écran externe, le Mac s’endort quand même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone is the microphone and the speaker. The work stays on this Mac, with its models. Everything is end-to-end encrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton iPhone sert de micro et de haut-parleur. Le travail reste sur ce Mac, avec ses modèles. Tout est chiffré de bout en bout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "already here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "déjà là"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "end of speech → first sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fin de parole → premier son"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone added": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone ajouté"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "interrupted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "interrompu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask for access the first time you need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS te demandera l’accès la première fois que tu en auras besoin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "or press": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ou appuie sur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tested": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "testé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "to talk": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pour parler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "untested / estimated": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "non testé / estimé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Ask first”: Maé says which shortcut she is about to run and waits for your “yes”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Demander d’abord » : Maé dit quel raccourci elle va lancer et attend ton « oui »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Tokens” are the word pieces the model works with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Mots » = tokens, les morceaux de mots du modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥ Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌥ Espace"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
